# Backlog

Open work only. When an item resolves or is canceled, move its entry to a
skim-only `backlog-archive.md` rather than leaving it here.

## Triage Tags

- `[MVP]`: needed before the current slice is trustworthy.
- `[domain]`: bounded-context or shared-kernel implementation work.
- `[frontend]`: app/API/user-surface work.
- `[hygiene]`: doc/tooling cleanup that protects the SSOT.

## Status Values

- `Deferred`: known work, not in active implementation.
- `Ready`: scoped enough to start when prioritized.
- `In progress`: partially landed; explicit remaining work still exists.
- `Blocked`: needs a named decision or external capability first.

